1
00:01:29,160 --> 00:01:30,490
What are you doing here?

2
00:01:31,200 --> 00:01:32,930
What a coincidence, Ms. Liang.

3
00:01:35,080 --> 00:01:35,920
What's wrong?

4
00:01:40,800 --> 00:01:42,400
Is it about my brother again?

5
00:01:45,120 --> 00:01:46,720
Why don't you reconsider me?

6
00:01:47,759 --> 00:01:48,560
Get lost.

7
00:01:50,039 --> 00:01:51,400
Ms. Liang,

8
00:01:51,840 --> 00:01:53,840
it'd be a shame if you hurt your hand.

9
00:01:58,160 --> 00:02:00,290
Drinks are on me tonight for Ms. Liang.

10
00:02:02,600 --> 00:02:03,400
My treat.

11
00:02:04,000 --> 00:02:05,040
I don't need you.

12
00:02:05,520 --> 00:02:07,520
I can pay for my own drinks.

13
00:02:16,800 --> 00:02:17,600
Get lost.

14
00:02:34,040 --> 00:02:35,240
He Yu.

15
00:02:43,120 --> 00:02:44,240
It tickles.

16
00:02:46,280 --> 00:02:47,720
Why are you tickling me?

17
00:02:47,720 --> 00:02:49,050
Stop. Stop tickling me.

18
00:02:50,120 --> 00:02:51,000
Stop it.

19
00:02:54,400 --> 00:02:55,079
Mrs. He,

20
00:02:55,079 --> 00:02:56,240
this is an eel.

21
00:02:56,240 --> 00:02:57,760
It can prevent athlete's foot.

22
00:02:57,760 --> 00:02:58,760
Take it away.

23
00:02:59,440 --> 00:03:00,200
Take it away.

24
00:03:01,040 --> 00:03:03,080
I specially sent someone
to buy it this morning.

25
00:03:03,080 --> 00:03:03,540
Mrs. He,

26
00:03:04,120 --> 00:03:05,120
it's so slippery.

27
00:03:05,800 --> 00:03:07,000
Take it away.

28
00:03:07,920 --> 00:03:08,650
Take it away.

29
00:03:08,680 --> 00:03:10,720
Then... I'll take it away.

30
00:03:10,720 --> 00:03:11,240
Take it away.

31
00:03:11,240 --> 00:03:12,370
Take it away. Hurry.

32
00:03:28,680 --> 00:03:29,480
Take it away.

33
00:03:29,640 --> 00:03:30,440
Mrs. He,

34
00:03:30,800 --> 00:03:32,360
eels are very nutritious.

35
00:03:32,760 --> 00:03:34,079
Don't make me slap you.

36
00:03:34,280 --> 00:03:35,880
If you won't eat it, I will.

37
00:03:36,040 --> 00:03:36,960
Bring it back.

38
00:03:45,800 --> 00:03:46,660
Where is He Shi?

39
00:03:47,640 --> 00:03:49,520
He Shi hasn't been back all night.

40
00:03:51,040 --> 00:03:52,040
Help!

41
00:03:53,840 --> 00:03:55,600
I'll beat you to death,
you little brat! Dad!

42
00:03:55,600 --> 00:03:56,840
I'll beat you to death!

43
00:03:56,840 --> 00:03:57,840
Beat you to death!

44
00:03:58,120 --> 00:03:58,920
I was wrong.

45
00:03:59,520 --> 00:03:59,920
I was wrong.

46
00:03:59,920 --> 00:04:00,780
Brother Liang.

47
00:04:01,880 --> 00:04:02,680
Dad.

48
00:04:02,680 --> 00:04:03,760
What's going on?

49
00:04:04,080 --> 00:04:05,080
Mr. He,

50
00:04:05,320 --> 00:04:07,560
I'm marrying my daughter
to your second son,

51
00:04:07,560 --> 00:04:08,890
not to be his concubine.

52
00:04:09,840 --> 00:04:11,800
What is the meaning of this?

53
00:04:12,040 --> 00:04:12,840
You tell them.

54
00:04:13,200 --> 00:04:14,520
She... She was drunk

55
00:04:14,520 --> 00:04:15,520
and mistook me for He Yu.

56
00:04:15,520 --> 00:04:16,399
Bullshit!

57
00:04:16,839 --> 00:04:18,120
You clearly drugged me.

58
00:04:18,120 --> 00:04:19,399
Good thing I woke up in time.

59
00:04:19,399 --> 00:04:19,680
Dad!

60
00:04:20,120 --> 00:04:20,440
Dad!

61
00:04:21,560 --> 00:04:22,480
You animal!

62
00:04:22,640 --> 00:04:24,080
Did you think I didn't know

63
00:04:24,080 --> 00:04:25,540
about your usual affairs?

64
00:04:25,960 --> 00:04:27,560
How dare you touch Ms. Liang!

65
00:04:28,280 --> 00:04:29,480
Dad, I was wrong! Dad!

66
00:04:32,200 --> 00:04:34,000
He Shi is the CEO of He Group.

67
00:04:34,040 --> 00:04:36,000
This is truly disgraceful.

68
00:04:36,400 --> 00:04:37,000
The whip.

69
00:04:37,280 --> 00:04:38,440
Li Zhangxin, you...

70
00:04:42,040 --> 00:04:43,320
Stop hitting He Shi.

71
00:04:44,960 --> 00:04:46,280
Shu Roujing, you...

72
00:04:47,400 --> 00:04:47,840
Dad!

73
00:04:47,840 --> 00:04:48,560
You animal!

74
00:04:48,560 --> 00:04:50,560
How dare you embarrass me out there!

75
00:04:51,280 --> 00:04:51,880
Dad!

76
00:04:54,120 --> 00:04:55,380
I'll beat you to death!

77
00:04:55,560 --> 00:04:56,240
Dad! You animal!

78
00:04:56,240 --> 00:04:56,880
Stop hitting him.

79
00:04:56,880 --> 00:04:58,000
Dad! You animal!

80
00:04:59,520 --> 00:05:00,440
Stop it.

81
00:05:00,720 --> 00:05:01,560
Dad, stop it.

82
00:05:01,560 --> 00:05:02,080
You bastard.

83
00:05:02,080 --> 00:05:03,320
Stop it.

84
00:05:03,880 --> 00:05:05,280
You'll cripple him.

85
00:05:06,240 --> 00:05:07,520
You bastard!

86
00:05:07,840 --> 00:05:09,080
From today on,

87
00:05:09,440 --> 00:05:11,640
you are no longer the CEO of He Group.

88
00:05:12,680 --> 00:05:13,960
Dad, please don't!

89
00:05:14,960 --> 00:05:15,760
No.

90
00:05:16,960 --> 00:05:18,560
Then what about my daughter?

91
00:05:18,600 --> 00:05:20,330
Her engagement party with He Yu

92
00:05:20,840 --> 00:05:22,240
will proceed as planned.

93
00:05:23,520 --> 00:05:24,320
I don't agree.

94
00:05:24,320 --> 00:05:26,280
Whoever dares to disobey me again

95
00:05:27,240 --> 00:05:28,840
can get out

96
00:05:28,840 --> 00:05:30,120
of here.

97
00:05:52,600 --> 00:05:53,440
Roujing,

98
00:05:53,480 --> 00:05:55,280
I'm here to apply your medicine.

99
00:05:57,040 --> 00:05:57,920
Honey,

100
00:05:58,640 --> 00:05:59,880
you're the best.

101
00:06:00,440 --> 00:06:02,500
You're the only one who came to see me.

102
00:06:03,400 --> 00:06:04,320
Hubby,

103
00:06:04,320 --> 00:06:06,200
you really dare to sleep with anyone, huh?

104
00:06:06,200 --> 00:06:07,240
I...

105
00:06:07,400 --> 00:06:08,760
She seduced me.

106
00:06:17,600 --> 00:06:19,560
What kind of medicine is this?
It hurts so much.

107
00:06:19,560 --> 00:06:21,040
It's to reduce the inflammation.

108
00:06:21,040 --> 00:06:21,640
Salt?

109
00:06:22,600 --> 00:06:23,720
Shu Roujing!

110
00:06:28,360 --> 00:06:29,120
Hubby,

111
00:06:29,120 --> 00:06:30,160
bear with it.

112
00:06:30,480 --> 00:06:32,400
I'm doing this for your own good.

113
00:06:36,000 --> 00:06:37,680
It breaks my heart too.

114
00:06:37,680 --> 00:06:38,680
Honey,

115
00:06:38,680 --> 00:06:40,080
I was wrong.

116
00:06:45,080 --> 00:06:46,010
Second Brother,

117
00:06:46,800 --> 00:06:48,120
where are you going?

118
00:06:49,000 --> 00:06:50,530
Since Dad is so firm on this,

119
00:06:51,159 --> 00:06:52,720
I'll just leave the He family.

120
00:06:52,720 --> 00:06:53,720
Aren't you playing right into

121
00:06:53,720 --> 00:06:55,480
Zhang Xin and He Shi's hands?

122
00:06:56,560 --> 00:06:57,400
Zhangxin,

123
00:06:57,920 --> 00:06:59,320
if I can't be with you,

124
00:06:59,400 --> 00:07:01,060
I'd rather never get married.

125
00:07:01,280 --> 00:07:02,520
But if you leave,

126
00:07:03,760 --> 00:07:05,800
who will protect me in this house?

127
00:07:06,680 --> 00:07:08,960
Let me talk to Dad again, okay?

128
00:07:16,280 --> 00:07:17,000
Come in.

129
00:07:22,000 --> 00:07:24,530
Have some Fu tea
to lower your blood pressure.

130
00:07:27,800 --> 00:07:30,280
I know you're worried about
what happened to the eldest brother.

131
00:07:30,280 --> 00:07:32,040
But the second brother shouldn't bear

132
00:07:32,040 --> 00:07:33,560
the consequences of his mistakes.

133
00:07:33,560 --> 00:07:35,620
I hope you don't make a rash decision.

134
00:07:40,440 --> 00:07:42,080
Recite the He family rules

135
00:07:42,080 --> 00:07:43,159
to me again.

136
00:07:43,400 --> 00:07:45,400
The family rules echo with lasting charm.

137
00:07:45,400 --> 00:07:47,240
The earnest advice in the hall lingers on.

138
00:07:47,240 --> 00:07:48,840
Parents' love and children's filial piety
weave a net of affection.

139
00:07:48,840 --> 00:07:50,400
Brothers respect each other
like flying geese.

140
00:07:50,400 --> 00:07:52,320
Elders are as steady and secure
as pine trees.

141
00:07:52,320 --> 00:07:53,850
A kind word warms the heart.

142
00:07:56,120 --> 00:07:58,080
In the He family, my word is law.

143
00:07:58,440 --> 00:07:59,640
The reason our family

144
00:07:59,920 --> 00:08:02,000
has prospered until now

145
00:08:02,080 --> 00:08:04,680
is because of unity and mutual help.

146
00:08:05,120 --> 00:08:06,120
As He Shi's younger brother,

147
00:08:06,120 --> 00:08:07,680
He Yu

148
00:08:07,880 --> 00:08:10,840
ought to fulfill
his brother's obligations.

149
00:08:11,080 --> 00:08:13,120
But if our hearts aren't together,

150
00:08:13,640 --> 00:08:16,240
what's the point of
the He family's existence?

151
00:08:17,160 --> 00:08:19,800
I went through so much trouble
to bring you back,

152
00:08:19,800 --> 00:08:21,800
not to have you lecture me.

153
00:08:22,440 --> 00:08:23,240
Dad,

154
00:08:24,040 --> 00:08:25,970
do you really care about Mom and me?

155
00:08:26,680 --> 00:08:28,320
Then why do you still keep Zhang Xin
in the He family

156
00:08:28,320 --> 00:08:30,080
when you know she harmed us?

157
00:08:30,240 --> 00:08:31,370
For all these years,

158
00:08:31,760 --> 00:08:34,280
if Zhang Xin hadn't been managing
the He family,

159
00:08:34,280 --> 00:08:36,400
it would have been a mess long ago.

160
00:08:37,440 --> 00:08:39,559
Now you want me to kick her out?

161
00:08:39,640 --> 00:08:40,960
How would the outside world

162
00:08:40,960 --> 00:08:42,400
judge us?

163
00:08:42,760 --> 00:08:43,600
As expected,

164
00:08:43,760 --> 00:08:45,240
the He family's reputation is

165
00:08:45,240 --> 00:08:46,880
the most important thing to you.

166
00:08:46,880 --> 00:08:48,880
Anyone can be a sacrifice.

167
00:09:06,200 --> 00:09:06,920
Madam,

168
00:09:08,720 --> 00:09:10,920
would you like anything to eat tonight?

169
00:10:12,960 --> 00:10:14,560
That's 150 GB.

170
00:10:15,520 --> 00:10:16,640
Thank goodness,

171
00:10:16,640 --> 00:10:17,640
they're all here.

172
00:10:18,920 --> 00:10:21,160
I'm still as charming as ever.

173
00:10:22,440 --> 00:10:23,600
I look pretty good

174
00:10:23,600 --> 00:10:25,000
from this angle.

175
00:10:34,760 --> 00:10:35,600
Exciting, baby?

176
00:10:35,600 --> 00:10:37,360
You're even wilder than me.

177
00:10:41,080 --> 00:10:42,000
He Shi,

178
00:10:42,400 --> 00:10:43,460
dressed like this,

179
00:10:43,800 --> 00:10:46,120
am I prettier than all the maids?
